messages.en:
Just digging up a fossil
won't do you any good.{01 00 00 0a 00}
'Cause it's just a rock!
{07 14 00}Have {ff 00 00 06}Blathers{ff 00 00 00} take a look,{01 00 00 05 00}
and he'll be able to tell
you what it is.

messages.et:
Fossiili lihtsalt üles
kaevamisest pole kasu.{01 00 00 0a 00}
Sest see on lihtsalt kivi!
{07 14 00}Lase {ff 00 00 06}Blathersil{ff 00 00 00} vaadata,{01 00 00 05 00}
ja ta oskab sulle öelda,
mis see on.

